00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:12,000
Samoa, tula'i ma sisi ia lau fu'a, lou pale lea!

2
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:22,000
Samoa, tula'i ma sisi ia lau fu'a, lou pale lea!

3
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:28,000
Vaai 'i na fetu o lo'ua agiagia ai:

4
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:33,000
Le faailoga lea o Iesu, na maliu ai mo Samoa.

5
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:44,000
Oi, Samoa e, u'u mau lau pule ia fa'avavau.

6
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:53,000
'Aua e te fefe;
o le Atua lo ta fa'avae, o lota sa'olotoga.

7
00:00:53,000 --> 00:01:03,000
Samoa, tula'i: 'ua agiagia lau fu'a, lou pale lea!